# Finder sidebar rows macconfig can name in the sidebar files.
# lib/finder-sidebar-rows.py reads these. It does not write the files.
#
#   id | where | want
#   where: top (TopSidebarSection), volumes (FavoriteVolumes), either
#   want:  hidden, visible, or first (visible, and the first visible row)
#
# A row the files do not name stays by hand. The Tags group collapsed is the
# defaults key SidebarTagsSctionDisclosedState (Apple's spelling). Recents
# hidden is the Finder sidebar Recents check. Neither is repeated here.
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.

shared|top|first
airdrop|either|hidden
icloud|either|hidden
home|volumes|visible
macintosh-hd|volumes|visible
network|volumes|visible
trash|volumes|visible
